Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 2.2.  Conceptual: random initialisation versus \
after-training.  At random init, labelled tokens are scattered through a \
Gaussian cloud with no structure.  After training, words of similar role \
cluster: articles with articles, pronouns with pronouns, punctuation off by \
itself.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dccad848-7333-4520-85c8-\
6f95383cde76"],

