Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 2.3.  Empirical: cosine similarity heatmap of \
eight high-frequency tokens at random init.  Diagonal = 1 (each token is \
identical to itself); off-diagonal entries are uniform noise centred near \
zero with standard deviation ~1/\[Sqrt]64 = 0.125, exactly the theoretical \
prediction for unit Gaussian vectors in 64 dimensions.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d24b981d-2fdd-48a0-b458-\
6da80f6db249"],

Cell["3.  Attention: the operation the architecture is named for", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"3f4d0249-ad44-41ed-a063-a814dcbf7070"],

