Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 3.2.  Empirical distribution of q\[CenterDot]k \
for three values of d_k.  Without scaling (left), the spread grows like \
\[Sqrt](d_k).  After dividing by \[Sqrt](d_k) (right), all three \
distributions collapse onto a unit-variance shape.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5dff5499-0b1e-4202-a8e9-\
586dadfee4df"],

Cell["\<\
The cost of skipping the divisor: softmax of a high-variance score row \
saturates onto a single entry, the gradient through softmax vanishes, \
training stalls.  Demo:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"44ccd819-ae5a-4680-b1bb-81b0150dfde5"],

