Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 3.5.  All 12 heads of layer 5 of GPT-2 small \
on the prompt \"The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog\".  Each row of \
each heatmap sums to one.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"efc478e8-6700-40c5-b2fc-\
cf60babf9bf3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two features jump out.  First, every head has a heavily-shaded ",
 "leftmost column \[LongDash] the ",
 StyleBox["attention sink",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " (Xiao et al. 2024): heads dump probability mass onto the first ",
 "token as a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]no-op\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] vote when \
they have nothing useful to do.  ",
 "Second, the heads are not all doing the same thing:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4abb39a5-9243-4340-a3d5-1fd3236bd523"],

