Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 6.3.  Throughput model: expected speedup vs \
draft length k for four accept rates, with the draft being 20x cheaper than \
the main.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"35fb16a2-7525-4d0c-b448-\
1157cd184db6"],

Cell["7.  Supervised fine-tuning", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"a1e81258-c6b4-41a2-910f-0b86ac85268b"],

Cell["\<\
The model after Section 5 can continue Shakespeare but has no concept of \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]a user asks a question, an assistant answers.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] Supervised fine-tuning teaches that concept by \
training the same next-token loss on a dataset formatted in a chat template.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"03579a69-dfb9-4f9f-b861-fb15ed82d6d9"],

