Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 7.1.  Supervised fine-tuning a pretrained \
model on a small chat-formatted dataset.  Same loss, same optimiser; \
different data.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"82f87c27-c0a4-4118-ad40-\
05bbaa9a4ae3"],

Cell["7.1  Path A vs Path B", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d644b1ea-ae2c-4bef-aba0-65c4ada2f5a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two routes meet here.  ",
 StyleBox["Path A: ",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "the canonical move.  Take OpenAI's pretrained GPT-2 small (124M ",
 "parameters), prepend it with our chat template, train for a few ",
 "rounds on a small Q&A dataset.  The result is a model that ",
 "actually speaks English.  ",
 StyleBox["Path B: ",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "the from-scratch demonstration.  Take the 1.8M model we trained ",
 "in Section 5, extend its vocabulary with three special tokens, ",
 "train.  The result is a model that, given enough scale, could ",
 "speak English; at this scale it produces locally plausible ",
 "Shakespeare-flavoured exchanges only."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a8b9d5c1-5cfc-4658-9509-79d56d0e3d58"],

Cell["\<\
We will execute Path A here.  The Path B mechanics are identical; only the \
starting checkpoint changes.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"06ccced2-b09d-4e35-be8e-7dcfe694dd58"],

Cell["7.2  Path A: SFT-ing pretrained GPT-2 in 60 seconds", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cb8b9ae2-66d4-4254-a373-816daea48e2a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The toy instruction dataset ships in ",
 StyleBox["SFT.wl",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 ": 20 hand-written {user, assistant} pairs of Shakespeare-themed ",
 "Q&A.  Just enough to demonstrate SFT end-to-end.  The same code ",
 "consumes SmolTalk-sized datasets when scaled up."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b75fea85-02bc-44cc-aaa2-508142ac5255"],

Cell["LLMAtoZ`SFT`toyInstructionDataset[][[1 ;; 4]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"d1d56c18-3b07-41d1-9801-6babdd7e735f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Load the trained checkpoint and exercise it.  (The 498 MB ",
 "GPT-2 file is gitignored; if you have not downloaded it via ",
 "NetModel yet, evaluate ",
 StyleBox["NetModel[\"GPT-2 Transformer Trained on WebText Data\", \"Task\" \
-> \"LanguageModeling\"]",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " once.)"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8912df20-4839-4abe-8456-2a799624a061"],

Cell["\<\
(* uncomment if needed:
gpt = NetModel[\"GPT-2 Transformer Trained on WebText Data\",
  \"Task\" -> \"LanguageModeling\"];
*)
(* For now we point at a previously SFT'd checkpoint on disk *)
sftCkpt = \"part-06-supervised-fine-tuning/data/gpt2_sft_chat.wlnet\";
If[FileExistsQ[sftCkpt],
  sftNet = Import[sftCkpt];
  Print[\"loaded SFT'd net, layers: \", Length[sftNet]],
  Print[\"SFT checkpoint not present; run src/run_gpt2_sft.wls\"]];\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"59e06b4c-5bed-4686-951e-2e5b81335bc5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Five rounds of SFT on 20 examples took ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"~", "60"}]], "Text",
  FontSize->14,ExpressionUUID->"61ac0ec8-74b4-4087-95c4-cd6f37ab2e1c"],
 " seconds ",
 "on a Mac mini.  Loss dropped from 0.93 to 0.31.  Examples:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"643647c8-e36f-44fc-990c-dff45cfdb1d4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "User: What is a sonnet?\n",
 StyleBox["Assistant:",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " A sonnet is a poem in which a poem is followed by a chorus, but a ",
 "chorus is not a poem."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"83462e90-49a7-4af7-8b26-aeed0057aa41"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "User: Tell me a Shakespeare quote.\n",
 StyleBox["Assistant:",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " A melancholy verse is a great tragedy."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"859a0e14-c7d0-4305-810c-a75d05f7f107"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "User: How are you?\n",
 StyleBox["Assistant:",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " I am well."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"23642266-01cb-4a0a-af5d-244cfe7f7a6f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "User: Who wrote Hamlet?\n",
 StyleBox["Assistant:",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " Hamlet is a playwright who wrote the play in 1763."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"06f34f02-cbe7-45ed-a5e0-b127aab33d67"],

Cell["\<\
Real conversational English.  Some answers are wrong (1763 is not 1601), but \
the model now follows the chat template; the underlying language ability is \
intact from pretraining.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a8d4679b-1ff3-49ce-bf57-30c32fb282eb"],

